feat(lpa-horizon): record the further post hoc outcomes and declare the matched-endpoint analysis

Adds the outcome of post hoc checks P3-P6 to the protocol document, the counts-only
feasibility job for an urgent-revascularization stand-in, and the declaration, reading
and written expectation of the matched-endpoint analysis, before any of its estimates
exists. The analysis script passed its synthetic self-test (LS6 job 3602910, 21 checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 


